  The $\\textit{AttoJoule Second}$ is the unit for the Planck's constant as product of the SI derived unit joule and the SI base unit second.
  """^^qudt:LatexString ;
    qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS>,
